      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "先生，女士，二位好。请问咱们这个移动平台的负责人在哪里，我们想问问能不能在这里留......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "人都跑光了，对谁负责去？你去帮我找点人来负责负责？！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "烦躁的老先生",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "camera_focus_unit",
            "data": {
              "id": "om",
              "offset": {
                "x": 0,
                "y": 0.5,
                "z": 0
              },
              "distance": 8,
              "duration": 0.5,
              "ease": "InOutSine"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "om",
              "animationName": "Angry",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "呃，原来您就是平台主人......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_embarrassed",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "烦躁的老先生",
            "content": "你们几个小孩子，没事在这前不着村后不着店的大荒野里瞎跑什么？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "不知道天黑得很快吗？要是一下子黑透了，你们就在这遍地都是的间歇泉眼之间摸黑赶路吧！你们的皮肤经得起腐蚀吗？！",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "烦躁的老先生",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "content": "我们确实有听说这片区域的泉水里的腐蚀成分浓度很高，溅到一星半点，皮肤都会发红好久，所以一路开车都很谨慎呢......",
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_embarrassed",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "camera_focus_unit",
            "data": {
              "id": "ang",
              "offset": {
                "x": 0.3,
                "y": 0.5,
                "z": 0
              },
              "distance": 8,
              "duration": 0.5,
              "ease": "InOutSine"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "只是，从地图上看，我们以为很快就会到下一站。结果半天都没个影子。既然您说到天黑，您看我们能不能......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2_embarrassed",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "烦躁的老先生",
            "content": "你那都是几几年的地图了？零号公路每个月都在变化，不仅有天灾砸它，喷出新的间歇泉还会扭曲它，拿着老地图能找准路才怪！",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        },
        "subLines": [
          {
            "type": "unit_animation",
            "data": {
              "id": "om",
              "animationName": "Angry",
              "pauseOnEnd": false
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "安洁莉娜",
            "content": "原来如此，看来之后的路也不好走呢。所以，我们很希望......",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_char_1015_aglna2",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "depth": 1,
        "leadLine": {
          "type": "dialog",
          "data": {
            "style": "LEFT_AVATAR",
            "name": "烦躁的老先生",
            "content": "地图拿来。喏，这里，是你们现在在的地方。下一站......下一站......你们也要去太阳谷？",
            "avatarId": "arkvent_npc_2351",
            "options": [],
            "avatarSource": "ACTIVITY"
          }
        }
      },
      {
